{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あれ、今日学校あったの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ううん、違うよ。昨日卒業式だった！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、\n制服から卒業できなかった中田。\n昨日の宣言通り今日も制服を着ました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何にも変えられないJKという名の\nキラキラのヴェールを脱ぎたくないのだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、昨日は卒業式があったわけだが\nそのあと\n家族でディンタイフォンってゆー\n中華料理屋さんに行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にHTC Jので台湾行った時に食べて\nおいしかったから\n日本の店舗に行った(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウォーアイニー　小籠包！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、\n今日は取材と収録がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/03/10/1717331/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録は乃木どこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材はまた告知します！\n話が止まらなかった←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/03/10/1717331/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いけど\nおやすみなさい(つω-｀).zZ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}